<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission 97/98 economic forecast for Germany.</title>
<headline>EU Commission 97/98 economic forecast for Germany.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Germany, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		2.3	   2.9</p>
<p> Investment			5.0	   6.5</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    1.9	   2.0</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    9.7	   9.5</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 3.0	   2.7</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		 61.8	  61.9</p>
</text>
